WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:07.700
Systems as a DOP. Your kit sits on your home screen, next to your diary.

2
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:15.300
Kit and day fees. Each item has its own day rate, and hired-in kit is marked.

3
00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:22.500
Camera package lines go on the invoice for the days they were on the job.

4
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:28.902
Every prep day is its own type: recce, tech recce, pre-light, and grade.

5
00:00:29.152 --> 00:00:35.303
And the kit cover sheet keeps your insurance and serials with each booking.

6
00:00:35.553 --> 00:00:43.703
Offers and holds land on your home screen. Answer them in one tap.

